0020-warm-up-manual-only.patch -- the shader warm-up ("Preparing the shaders", docs/DECISIONS.md 79 / 85, GameAppWarm.cs) becomes MANUAL ONLY. docs/CONFORMITY-AUDIT.md, row D-WARM.
Applied by scripts/build-app.sh to its copy of the C# snapshot (patch -p1, run in the project folder), after 0010 and before nothing else; app/gameapp/ is not edited.
  * GameAppMain.cs: no warm-up at the end of a build (Finish), none at a launch (StartWarmAtLaunch keeps only the debug launch argument); a "Prepare the shaders..." / "Stop preparing
    the shaders" button in the game settings sheet (library AND an exported player's Settings), offered only when the game has a library of this host's chain.
  * GameAppWarm.cs: GameWarm.Enabled (the warm_shaders row that defaulted to on) is gone; GameWarm.HasLibrary; the sheet's action asks, then starts or stops one run.
